<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;">{!Lead.FirstName},<br><br>I
 just wanted to send you a quick note to remind you that National Funding is ready to help your business when you are in need of cash or 
working capital.&nbsp; <br><br><em>The National Funding Advantages Include:</em></p><ul><li>Funds can be used for nearly any business purpose</li><li>Cash in your account in as few as 3 business days</li><li>Can qualify up to $150,000 in working capital</li><li>Personal service</li></ul><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify;">Whether
 your business takes credit cards or not, we can get you the cash you 
need for expenses, expansion, inventory, advertising, taxes and more!&nbsp; 
We are here to help small businesses grow and prosper.<br><br>I look forward to working with you! <br></p><p><br></p><p>{!Lead.OwnerFullName}<span style="font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"></span><br><span style="font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;">National Funding</span><br>Phone:&nbsp; {!Lead.OwnerPhone}<br>Email:&nbsp; {!Lead.OwnerEmail}</p>]]></td>
</tr>
